{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17102","headline":"奉陪武相公西亭夜[宴]陆郎中 · 萧祜","name":"奉陪武相公西亭夜[宴]陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弘阁陈芳宴，佳宾此会难。\n交逢贵日重，醉得少时欢。\n舒黛凝歌思，求音足笔端。\n一闻清佩动，珠玉夜珊珊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}